[I] Yet Another JSON Library (YAJL)

[T] YAJL (Yet Another JSON Library) is a small event-driven (SAX-style) JSON
[T] parser and generator written in ANSI C, with a tree API on top. It is
[T] portable, robust and fast and supports incremental parsing of streams.

[U] https://github.com/lloyd/yajl/

[A] Lloyd Hilaiel
[M] Gerardo Di Iorio <arete74@gmail.com>

